               <field name="value">Sabogal-Palma, A. C., Zapata-Ocampo, P. A., Rodríguez-Cabal, H. A., Ocampo-Jiménez, O., Méndez-Arteaga, J. J., &amp; Monsalve, Z. I. (2024). Evaluation of the potential use of the by-products of Passiflora maliformis L. and Passiflora edulis Sims from the Southern Colombian Massif as dietary fibre and prebiotic activity. International Journal of Food Science &amp; Technology, 59(6), 3744-3754. https://doi.org/10.1111/ijfs.17116</field>
